Class E Private IP Range Allocation Plan

1. Objective

The purpose of this document is to define the allocation and management strategy for the Class E IP range (240.0.0.0/4), which will be repurposed for private, non-production, and experimental infrastructure. This plan ensures efficient usage, prevents conflicts, and supports scalability.

2. IP Range Overview
	•	Class E IP Range: 240.0.0.0 – 255.255.255.255
	•	Total Available Addresses: 268,435,456
	•	Subnet Mask: /4

